rem Right Triangles with Integer Points
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=91
rem Count right triangles OPQ on a grid
rem of integer points 0 to Size

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Size integer = 50

rem 3N^2 have the right angle at O or on
rem an axis. Otherwise from P = (x, y)
rem step along (y, -x) / gcd; both sides
rem count alike by symmetry.
Ids = 1 to Size array
X = Ids reshape Size 1
Y = Ids reshape 1 Size
G = X Y gcd
Down' = (Size - X) * G // Y
Left' = Y * G // X
Inner' = Down Left min
Cells = Inner sum
Answer = 3 * Size * Size + 2 * Cells
Answer print
